    en:{"guide.helpDescription":"Use Explain or Answer when you need focused help understanding the lesson.","guide.helpInstruction":"Zova processes the request in the background and returns the result directly to Smart Class.","guide.studyDetailTitle":"From Learning Map to Study Detail","guide.studyDetailDescription":"The class sets the subject and scope. Zova organizes it into Chapters, Topics and Concepts, then lets you open one focused learning unit at a time.","guide.studyDetailNote":"Not every section appears for every concept. Study Detail uses the sections that help with the selected part of the class.","support.helpTitle":"Explain / Answer"},
